Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:10.91,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Totally, baby
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:12.24,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}It's love, baby
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:14.30,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:16.86,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Give me a princess's tiara
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:22.68,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Sparkle at me, sparkle however you like
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:29.26,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}We know how to go all out (We girls do)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.80,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}We don't know anything (about you)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:36.44,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Real kindness isn't all about being strong
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:41.02,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}You don't say it, it's not fair
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.02,0:05:43.60,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}I want to see (I love you)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:45.53,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}who you love most, please
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:50.88,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}The round world spins around
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:55.50,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}A golden sun, an awaited kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:06:01.47,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Love is jealousy, have it nice and sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:05.79,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Round, sweet baby, work hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:10.81,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Who owns that heart? (It isn't mine)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:15.77,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}It isn't anyone's, because it's free
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:20.80,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Does it have wings? Chase around it whimsically
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:23.16,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Where is it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:26.19,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}I had a wild wish
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:30.11,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Grant my wish. It's fun, so there's no problem
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:31.29,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Squeeze me, baby
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:32.65,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}It's love, baby
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.65,0:06:34.62,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Understand this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.00,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Get a little greedy, princess tiara
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:40.81,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}I'm sparkling, too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:43.14,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(150,150)}Sparkling however I want to
