Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.38,0:27:36.21,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Lots, tons, everything, all of it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.21,0:27:38.88,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}I want pure love, give me a bunch
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.88,0:27:41.59,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Lots, tons, everything, all of it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.59,0:27:44.76,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}I'll give you love, please take it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.80,0:27:57.68,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Don't underestimate it, don't get cocky
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.68,0:28:00.31,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}I'll tell you why
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.31,0:28:05.58,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}I don't want to be a friend, I want clear love
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.58,0:28:08.29,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Don't go any further, don't touch there
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.29,0:28:10.79,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}I'll cast a spell on you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.79,0:28:16.29,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}All the electronic sounds, my heart goes beep, spark, flash
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.29,0:28:21.63,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Let's turn "mute" off and love each other
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.63,0:28:24.31,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Make me make sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.31,0:28:29.47,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Oh, a heartbreaking, ambitious forte!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.47,0:28:34.85,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Even if I befriend all these people
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.85,0:28:39.90,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}I'm interested in only one; I see only you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.90,0:28:45.61,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}I'm in this huge crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.61,0:28:50.33,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}So you don't notice me... you're mean
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.33,0:28:55.90,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Meeting in a dream is no fun
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:29:01.68,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Get hotter and hotter!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.95,0:00:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome home.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.63,0:00:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only just come back myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.85,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's forecast was spot-on! We had the first tropical day of the year.{What's a tropical day?}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.11,0:00:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.81,0:00:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That smells great!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.40,0:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I made coffee, Miharu{-nee}.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.24,0:00:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, there's some for you, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, my prince!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.91,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've just finished baking some cookies.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.68,0:00:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.71,0:01:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:00.42,0:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go and wash your hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.96,0:01:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you a snack.{She says "ocha," but (as many people wouldn't know) "ocha" is loosely used as "a snack."}
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.50,0:01:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:07.93,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.86,0:01:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is me!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:11.37,0:01:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They took some pictures of me when I was walking around town!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.26,0:01:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Rikka{-chan}. You look just like a real model. It's so cool!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.26,0:01:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that models get loads of fan letters from boys!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.63,0:01:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no good at all!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.94,0:01:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Men are repulsive.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:32.44,0:01:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.86,0:01:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already decided that Onii-chan is the one for me!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.87,0:01:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still a man!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.82,0:01:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you before that I'd rather die than have a guy live with us!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.16,0:01:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still saying that?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.67,0:01:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan is part of our family.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.21,0:01:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what it is!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.59,0:01:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually love him, don't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.41,0:02:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that you always pick on the ones you like.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.47,0:02:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Urara{-chan}, you're so adorable!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.36,0:02:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it at all!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.04,0:02:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I just really truly...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.98,0:02:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,hate guys!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.18,0:02:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like to go read outside today.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.69,0:02:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go out for a bit?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.03,0:02:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Miharu's forecast, the highest temperature will be 32 degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.37,0:02:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be a little too hot for us.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.31,0:02:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stay in the shade though, the wind\Nshould cool us and we'll probably be okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.16,0:02:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They do say that negative ions in\Nthe air are good for your health.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.43,0:02:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Fubuki{-chan}.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.52,0:02:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait right there!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.77,0:02:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! The Red Cliff Attack taught by Kong Ming himself!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.98,0:02:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt, false witch!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:55.12,0:02:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Lucky Honeymoon B-B-Beam!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.28,0:03:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, all of you!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.80,0:03:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, attack with cake if you have no bread!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.79,0:03:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, play with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.25,0:03:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been a good girl, so please pat me.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.51,0:03:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna play with Onii-chan, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.89,0:03:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:31.94,0:03:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.61,0:03:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake, A-chan?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.03,0:03:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.33,0:03:46.66,Overlap,,0,0,0,,It's so hot today.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.66,0:03:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.27,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What a welcome.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.69,0:03:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Manservant?!{This is my dictionary's TL. I say "slave."}
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.88,0:04:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit staring at me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.97,0:04:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't hurt, are you, Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.29,0:04:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.72,0:04:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.92,0:04:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really mind. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.44,0:04:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're family after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.38,0:04:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This Manservant's not family!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.17,0:04:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never going to accept him!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.99,0:04:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear. What's my cute little daughter saying?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.83,0:04:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.75,0:04:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get along even though you're siblings? It breaks my heart!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.71,0:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.86,0:04:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking of getting our office to make a promotion video for all of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.61,0:04:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you be the cameraman?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.68,0:04:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If we all take a trip for the shoot, I'm sure\Nyou'll all get closer to one another!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.27,0:04:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? Let's do it!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.82,0:05:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom never listens once she's decided something.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.59,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear with her, 'kay?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.93,0:07:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Hikaru{-onee-chan}!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.11,0:07:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Seika{-chan}!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.69,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of magical fish!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.72,0:07:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Lemme see!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.51,0:07:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.04,0:07:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you{\fscx200}-{\r}!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.02,0:07:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.74,0:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.16,0:07:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out my swimsuit!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.09,0:07:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.60,0:07:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My prince is looking at me in a swimsuit.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.42,0:07:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart won't stop pounding.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.13,0:07:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why've you got a towel round you?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.98,0:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.03,0:07:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! A school swimsuit?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.56,0:07:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The other suits were all too flashy, so I couldn't pick one!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? There's something on your butt.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.57,0:07:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A bug?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.37,0:07:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha{\fscx200}-{\r} Get it off!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.46,0:07:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it off!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! What is it?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.24,0:07:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on my butt?! {MY PE- nevermind.}
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.79,0:08:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Onii-chan?!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just do?!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:10.58,0:08:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:12.84,0:08:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There was something on Urara{-chan}'s swimsuit, so...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.38,0:08:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He touched my butt.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.81,0:08:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never {\i1}ever{\i0} forgive you!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.36,0:08:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call Mom up and go home!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.10,0:08:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I couldn't go on a trip with a gu{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 99,0:08:30.84,0:08:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a hole in your swimsuit.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:34.73,0:08:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's smaller than a spec of space dust.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.82,0:08:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:38.90,0:08:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He found the hole.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, you're so kind!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.66,0:08:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Urara, maybe you're overthinking things.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.31,0:08:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't worry about the swimsuit or the hole.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.85,0:08:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just embarrassed, right, Urara{-chan}?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.66,0:08:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You needn't worry. It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.05,0:09:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all go play. Okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.84,0:09:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A-chan's in diapers,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.10,0:09:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but just look at how bold she is!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.46,0:09:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a hand?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.45,0:09:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare film me.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.09,0:09:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single shot!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.33,0:09:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.63,0:09:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do about us being here,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.78,0:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't come anywhere near me on this trip!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.22,0:09:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like she really hates you.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.69,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. Why don't you film them for now?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:53.76,0:09:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put some on you, too, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.00,0:09:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.30,0:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Rub, rub...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.33,0:10:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I always drop my ice cream 'cause I eat so slowly!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.72,0:10:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.93,0:10:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I love you, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.02,0:10:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.55,0:10:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a kiss too!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.01,0:10:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.42,0:10:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie's foot is dirty.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:23.86,0:10:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you kindly clean it?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you permission to touch me. {BANZAAAAAAAAAAAAI}
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you're special.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.19,0:10:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to swim?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.40,0:10:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy enough just watching everybody else play.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.24,0:10:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister Kosame{-chan}.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.57,0:10:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I am somewhat troubled.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.94,0:10:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to pee?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.75,0:10:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your help is appreciated.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.13,0:11:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go too!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.26,0:11:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.09,0:11:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:03.00,0:11:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:03.87,0:11:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.43,0:11:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Carry me, my brother{-chan}!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.36,0:11:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense a reassuring aura when you carry me.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.60,0:11:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Ninetails?{kyubi: fox of nine tails}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.10,0:11:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite close.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.59,0:11:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,About that thing earlier...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.10,0:11:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll forgive you if you take a photo of the train on the way home!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.52,0:11:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:42.48,0:11:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You look beautiful in that school swimsuit.
