Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.05,0:12:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But... thanks. {OOH LA-LA, URARA (U SEE WAT I DID THAR)}
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.05,0:12:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I was sleeping and{\fscx200}-{Wait, wait, how the hell did that scene change work?}
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.18,0:12:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hands are quite rough. {And your chest is very flat.}
