Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.26,0:12:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.91,0:13:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Boing!{As you can see here, as the body of the player accelerates, the inertia of the oppai makes them lag behind for a split second; however, the sudden acceleration afterwards propels the player toward the ball, allowing for very quick dives. Also, the oppai serve as excellent cushions for the arms during a bump, guiding the arms into a perfect form.}
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.34,0:13:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Onii-chan? {I feel like I've heard this line too many times already}
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.16,0:13:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to Yuuna!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.72,0:13:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain, pain, go away!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.47,0:13:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no fair, Yuuna{-chan}!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.64,0:13:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I will offer these lips to my dearest brother...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.63,0:13:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Next round!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.95,0:13:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.91,0:13:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.57,0:13:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:30.18,0:13:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance! {AND THEN COMES THE ECCHI ACCIDENT}
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.60,0:13:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsurara{-onee-chan}, we're starting to drift far away.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.48,0:13:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yuki. This is nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.44,0:14:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That surprised me!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.43,0:14:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold onto me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.47,0:14:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.26,0:14:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.46,0:14:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone... help!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.57,0:14:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsurara, Watayuki!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.30,0:14:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Manservant, I'm glad you're here!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:33.07,0:14:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.83,0:14:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us, please!
