Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.36,0:14:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay, Yuki; Manservant is here.{wow, she still keeps that up.}
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.87,0:14:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mizore{-onee-chan}!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:52.42,0:14:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.55,0:15:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good. The current's too strong!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.74,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mizore{-nee}!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.13,0:15:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab hold of the rope! {quit hiding that oppai u retard}
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.18,0:15:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing, Brother!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.92,0:15:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stunned!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.06,0:15:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so awesome, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.85,0:15:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so cool, Mizore{-onee-chan}!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-um...
