Dialogue: 99,0:16:05.12,0:16:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't know? This is a family bath, and we've got it all to ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.94,0:16:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy. Come on in.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.53,0:16:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.76,0:16:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. We're family.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.58,0:16:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you tired from filming and dealing with Tsurara?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.25,0:16:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Rikka{-chan}, don't touch me in strange places!
