Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.90,0:16:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you have the potential.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.84,0:16:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Hotaru{-chan}.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:39.59,0:16:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Recently, my bra's been a little...
