Dialogue: 99,0:16:52.30,0:16:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I got so tanned in one day!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.01,0:16:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Rikka's younger than me, yet still...
