Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.78,0:17:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.29,0:17:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't rush. Be careful.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.11,0:17:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.28,0:17:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let you see!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.16,0:17:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! It's huge! {No, not your penis, viewer, she's talking about the bath.}
Dialogue: 99,0:17:42.40,0:17:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're here, too, Hikaru{-chan}.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:46.34,0:17:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. {I'm sorry, but those bubbles really look like fart bubbles.}
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.69,0:18:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.07,0:18:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm exercising!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.28,0:18:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, exercising!
