Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.45,0:19:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go again!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:07.81,0:19:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that, Rikka{-chan}. They'll all cop{\fscx200}-
