Dialogue: 99,0:19:18.42,0:19:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,920)}Begin surfacing now.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.41,0:19:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You pervert!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.75,0:19:45.29,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's dangerous!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:45.29,0:19:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
