Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.38,0:20:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to you...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.57,0:20:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I got sunburnt badly today,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.79,0:20:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,so my back's tingling so much I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.47,0:20:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please massage this lotion onto my back?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:46.14,0:20:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Work's kept me so busy lately. Could you do me too?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.97,0:20:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that you're busy.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.35,0:20:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be with you through the night, my prince.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.24,0:21:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.21,0:21:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Miharu{Onee-chan}?! {I wish I were in that futon.}
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.40,0:21:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.40,0:21:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had the impulse to tease my cute little brother.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.32,0:21:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.10,0:21:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, my prince!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.92,0:21:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Miharu{Onee-chan}?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:17.42,0:21:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.50,0:21:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot.
