Dialogue: 99,0:21:22.00,0:21:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.13,0:21:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In summer, girls just {\i1}have{\i0} to wear miniskirts
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.88,0:21:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and show some skin!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.51,0:21:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.45,0:21:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I wanted you to see the costume that I made.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.98,0:21:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So Onii-chan, am I super cute?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stunning? {HAI SOUDESU!}
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.40,0:21:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bad girl.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.30,0:21:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to have you for myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.72,0:21:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bad girl... aren't I?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.50,0:21:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing with Miharu{-onee-chan}?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:00.68,0:22:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a grown up girl, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.80,0:22:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you that I'm not a little girl anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.43,0:22:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing so late at night?!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.35,0:22:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being noisy!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.92,0:22:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back to your rooms!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.40,0:22:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Five seconds till Tsurara{-chan} explodes!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:26.36,0:22:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a minute?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.69,0:22:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.80,0:22:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. You don't have to explain anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:47.37,0:22:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it all
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.81,0:22:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,because I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.93,0:22:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't thank you for saving me earlier.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:02.48,0:23:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:06.11,0:23:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a fever?!
