Dialogue: 99,0:23:20.88,0:23:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stare at me like that. {She's... glowing... red...}
Dialogue: 99,0:23:23.85,0:23:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can't stop staring...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:29.72,0:23:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What've we got here? What a scoop.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:33.30,0:23:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mizore{-neesama}!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:35.14,0:23:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 99,0:23:37.02,0:23:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to kiss him, weren't you?
