Dialogue: 99,0:23:39.96,0:23:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As if.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:40.81,0:23:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I try then?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:44.63,0:23:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:45.66,0:23:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I said nothing happened!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:47.34,0:23:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Later, Manservant!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.74,0:23:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so fun to tease Tsurara.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:54.85,0:23:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.62,0:24:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold still.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:06.92,0:24:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind at all if it's you.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:15.33,0:24:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is less significant than space dust.
