Dialogue: 99,0:24:46.81,0:24:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you look.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:48.50,0:24:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine! I was about to go back because it's getting late.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.09,0:24:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 99,0:24:58.39,0:24:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:03.16,0:25:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
