Dialogue: 99,0:25:08.88,0:25:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:10.04,0:25:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing too much!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.15,0:25:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm completely fine!
