Dialogue: 99,0:25:16.24,0:25:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the back of my knees{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 99,0:25:17.67,0:25:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move around!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:19.80,0:25:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:27.06,0:25:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop...
