Dialogue: 99,0:25:34.89,0:25:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too embarrassing.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:44.83,0:25:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's miraculous that, of the countless people in the world, you became part of our family.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:55.00,0:26:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're doing a good job.\NEveryone is treating you as part of the family.
