Dialogue: 99,0:27:16.91,0:27:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you, Manservant?!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:17.64,0:27:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha{\fscx200}- {\r}Stop! That's dangerous!
